          ],
          "content": "Ganita Prakash | Grade 6"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.12,
            0.353,
            0.142
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.15,
            0.764,
            0.169
          ],
          "content": "1. At what number is ‘idli-vada’ said for the 10th time?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.173,
            0.783,
            0.193
          ],
          "content": "2.\t If the game is played for the numbers 1 to 90, find out:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.245,
            0.195,
            0.884,
            0.239
          ],
          "content": "a. How many times would the children say ‘idli’ (including the times they say ‘idli-vada’)?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.245,
            0.241,
            0.884,
            0.284
          ],
          "content": "b. How many times would the children say ‘vada’ (including the times they say ‘idli-vada’)?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.246,
            0.286,
            0.798,
            0.306
          ],
          "content": "c. How many times would the children say ‘idli-vada’?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.309,
            0.588,
            0.375
          ],
          "content": "3. What if the game was played till 900? How would your answers change?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.377,
            0.587,
            0.421
          ],
          "content": "4.\t Is this figure somehow related to the ‘idli-vada’ game?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.245,
            0.426,
            0.574,
            0.494
          ],
          "content": "Hint: Imagine playing the game till 30. Draw the figure if the game is played till 60."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.595,
            0.315,
            0.891,
            0.537
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_image_11.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.514,
            0.579,
            0.556
          ],
          "content": "Let us now play the ‘idli-vada’ game with different pairs of numbers:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.711,
            0.543,
            0.773,
            0.56
          ],
          "content": "Fig. 5.1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.555,
            0.32,
            0.574
          ],
          "content": "a. 2 and 5,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.574,
            0.32,
            0.594
          ],
          "content": "b. 3 and 7,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.595,
            0.319,
            0.614
          ],
          "content": "c. 4 and 6."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.621,
            0.885,
            0.691
          ],
          "content": "We will say ‘idli’ for multiples of the smaller number, ‘vada’ for multiples of the larger number and ‘idli-vada’ for common multiples. Draw a figure similar to Fig. 5.1 if the game is played up to 60."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.703,
            0.864,
            0.902
          ],
